; Desolation New Age - persistent world item spawns
;
; Section name = level name.
; Each line contains ONLY:
;     item_or_variant = x, y, z
;
; Coordinates should be the ground/location coordinates from the position recorder.
; The script internally drops the item 1.0m above Y using the engine's normal
; drop_item_and_teleport path so physics/collision initializes correctly.
;
; IMPORTANT: LTX keys must be unique inside a section. If you want the SAME item
; more than once on one level, append #anything to the key. The script strips it:
;     bandage#1 = 10, 2, 20
;     bandage#2 = 15, 2, 25

